\fs14\
\f1 \b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 The NSTextAttachmentCell protocol declares the interface for objects that draw text attachment icons and handle mouse events on their icons. With the exceptions of \b cellBaselineOffset:\b0 , \b setAttachment:\b0  and \b attachment\b0 , all of these methods are implemented by the NSCell class and described in that class specification.\
\fs14\
\fs28 See the NSAttributedString and NSTextView class specifications for general information on text attachments.\
\fs14\
